  "summary": "Senior Software Engineer with nearly 9 years of experience designing, building, and modernizing enterprise applications using the Microsoft technology stack. I specialize in developing scalable, cloud-native solutions with C#, .NET, React, Azure, and modern software architecture that enable organizations to deliver secure, reliable, and high-performing applications.\n\nMy experience spans the full software development lifecycle, from solution design and backend services to modern React front ends, REST APIs, microservices, and cloud deployments. I have led the development of enterprise applications, integrated complex third-party systems, implemented secure authentication with Azure AD B2C, and built event-driven solutions using Kafka to support scalable, distributed systems.\n\nI enjoy solving complex technical challenges by designing clean, maintainable software and improving engineering processes through automation, CI/CD, cloud technologies, and modern development practices. My recent work includes building cloud-native microservices, implementing Entity Framework Core with PostgreSQL, securing applications with Azure Key Vault, improving observability with Application Insights, and streamlining deployments with Azure DevOps.\n\nI work closely with product managers, architects, QA engineers, and cross-functional teams to translate business requirements into technical solutions. I contribute to architecture discussions, perform code reviews, mentor developers, and promote engineering best practices that improve software quality and team productivity.\nCore technologies: C#, .NET, ASP.NET Core, React, TypeScript, Azure, Azure DevOps, REST APIs, Microservices, Kafka,  SQL Server, PostgreSQL, Entity Framework Core, Docker, CI/CD, Azure AD B2C, Azure Key Vault, Azure Application Insights, Git, and GitHub Copilot.\n\nI have earned the Microsoft Certified: Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900) certification and continue expanding my expertise in cloud-native architecture, distributed systems, and modern software engineering.\n\nI am open to opportunities where I can help engineering teams build scalable cloud applications, solve complex technical problems, and deliver meaningful business impact.",
